{
 "name": "HL · Posting week · approve",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Posting week: approve (Lesson 5.4)\nFridays 16:00: one Telegram message per calendar item with the photo and every platform version. Tolu chooses Approve, Edit or Skip. Edits come back as lines like instagram: new caption, and replace that caption. Approved rows get status approved. Versions marked needs_edit stay unapproved until Tolu edits them.\n\nCredentials: Google Sheets; Telegram.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 480
   },
   "id": "b3f74b91-1639-4664-894a-f09f809bc5bf",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -540,
    -300
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
